sequenceDiagram
    participant Pos as PosTerminal
    participant Store as OfflineSalesStore
    participant Api as ReturnOrderHandler
    participant Inv as Inventory
    participant Tef as IPaymentTerminal

    Pos->>Store: CreateAndPay with discount
    Store->>Store: Validate MaxDiscountPercent
    Store->>Store: Pay plus CommissionAccruals
    Pos->>Store: ReturnOrder items
    Store->>Store: Credit local stock
    Store->>Store: RefundPayment net
    Store->>Outbox: ReturnOrderCommand
    Outbox->>Api: ReturnOrder replay
    Api->>Inv: RestoreStockForSaleReturn
    Api->>Tef: Refund when electronic
    Api->>Api: Reverse commissions
